orquestrador e da retomada. Referências: [transcription-pipeline-requirements.md#L28](/home/gabriel/personals/dnd-transcription/.omx/plans/transcription-pipeline-requirements.md#L28), [transcription-pipeline-requirements.md#L32](/home/gabriel/personals/dnd-transcription/.omx/plans/transcription-pipeline-requirements.md#L32), [phase-01-transcription-pipeline.md#L108](/home/gabriel/personals/dnd-transcription/.omx/plans/phase-01-transcription-pipeline.md#L108), [phase-01-transcription-pipeline.md#L115](/home/gabriel/personals/dnd-transcription/.omx/plans/phase-01-transcription-pipeline.md#L115), [phase-01-transcription-pipeline-verification.md#L22](/home/gabriel/personals/dnd-transcription/.omx/plans/phase-01-transcription-pipeline-verification.md#L22).\n\n- `NORMAL` O runtime do `$team` ainda está atrás do planejamento. `omx team status` mostrou backend ativo, porém sem `taskQueue`; `omx hud` mostrou sessão inativa e 1 inbox aberto; e o item em [inbox.json#L1](/home/gabriel/personals/dnd-transcription/.omx/state/inbox.json#L1) é apenas “Team initialized”. Não bloqueia o conteúdo do plano, mas ainda não atende bem a regra de inbox como próximo passo explícito.\n\n**Resumo**\n\nOs bloqueios anteriores foram corrigidos: agora há alinhamento explícito para verificação `>3h`, unidade temporal da CLI, `job-state.json`, `cleanupPolicy`, e ausência de consolidado em falha parcial. Esse avanço aparece de forma consistente em [transcription-pipeline-requirements.md#L19](/home/gabriel/personals/dnd-transcription/.omx/plans/transcription-pipeline-requirements.md#L19), [phase-01-transcription-pipeline.md#L53](/home/gabriel/personals/dnd-transcription/.omx/plans/phase-01-transcription-pipeline.md#L53) e [phase-01-transcription-pipeline-verification.md#L11](/home/gabriel/personals/dnd-transcription/.omx/plans/phase-01-transcription-pipeline-verification.md#L11).\n\n**Veredito**\n\n`changes requested`.\n\nPróxima ação recomendada: fechar o contrato de retomada e a máquina de estados