2026-04-10T15:34:36.272Z PostToolUse status=unknown {"session_id":"019d77ee-8ec1-7641-9021-76f0e1597510","turn_id":"019d77ef-dcf7-76b3-95c4-e865c310d26c","transcript_path":"/home/gabriel/.codex/sessions/2026/04/10/rollout-2026-04-10T12-06-56-019d77ee-8ec1-7641-9021-76f0e1597510.jsonl","cwd":"/home/gabriel/personals/dnd-transcription","hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","model":"gpt-5.4","permission_mode":"default","tool_name":"Bash","tool_input":{"command":"nl -ba .omx/logs/execution-ledger.md | sed -n '1,200p'"},"tool_response":"     1\t# Execution Ledger\n     2\t\n     3\t## 2026-04-10\n     4\t\n     5\t- Implementado projeto Node/TypeScript greenfield para o pipeline de transcricao descrito em `.omx/plans/transcription-pipeline-requirements.md`.\n     6\t- Adicionados contratos de dominio para `Transcriber`, `MediaSegmenter`, manifesto e `job-state.json` com maquina de estados explicita.\n     7\t- Implementados `FFmpegMediaSegmenter`, `FileJobStore`, `FakeTranscriber`, pool de concorrencia, `resume` deterministico e merge final baseado no manifesto persistido.\n     8\t- Adicionados testes unitarios e integrados cobrindo manifesto, parse de CLI, task pool, falha parcial, `--resume`, recuperacao de chunk `running` orfao e ordenacao final.\n     9\t- Registrado script dedicado `npm run verify:long-input` para gerar e validar input sintetico acima de 3 horas; a execucao no host atual falhou por ausencia de `ffmpeg` no `PATH`.\n    10\t\n    11\t## Evidencias\n    12\t\n    13\t- `npm run build`\n    14\t- `npm test`\n    15\t- `npm run verify:long-input` -> falhou com `Comando externo nao encontrado no PATH: ffmpeg`\n","tool_use_id":"call_vS8wdy0HDgU91hVBS3Z037zC"}
2026-04-10T15:34:36.289Z PostToolUse status=unknown {"session_id":"019d77ee-8ec1-7641-9021-76f0e1597510","turn_id":"019d77ef-dcf7-76b3-95c4-e865c310d26c","transcript_path":"/home/gabriel/.codex/sessions/2026/04/10/rollout-2026-04-10T12-06-56-019d77ee-8ec1-7641-9021-76f0e1597510.jsonl","cwd":"/home/gabriel/personals/dnd-transcription","hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","model":"gpt-5.4","permission_mode":"default","tool_name":"Bash","tool_input":{"command":"nl -ba README.md | sed -n '1,220p'"},"tool_response":"     1\t# dnd-transcription\n     2\t\n     3\tCLI em TypeScript para fracionar arquivos `.mkv` longos em chunks `.wav`, transcrever os chunks em paralelo por meio de uma porta `Transcriber` substituivel e consolidar a saida em markdown ordenado cronologicamente.\n     4\t\n     5\t## Requisitos\n     6\t\n     7\t- Node.js 20+\n     8\t- `ffmpeg` e `ffprobe` disponiveis no `PATH`\n     9\t\n    10\t## Uso\n    11\t\n    12\t```bash\n    13\tnpm install\n    14\tnpm run transcribe -- \\\n    15\t  --input ./fixtures/sample.mkv \\\n    16\t  --output ./tmp/job-01 \\\n    17\t  --chunk-duration-seconds 600 \\\n    18\t  --concurrency 4 \\\n    19\t  --provider fake \\\n    20\t  --cleanup-policy on-success\n    21\t```\n    22\t\n    23\tPara retomar um job parcial:\n    24\t\n    25\t```bash\n    26\tnpm run transcribe -- \\\n    27\t  --input ./fixtures/sample.mkv \\\n    28\t  --output ./tmp/job-01 \\\n    29\t  --chunk-duration-seconds 600 \\\n    30\t  --concurrency 4 \\\n    31\t  --provider fake \\\n    32\t  --cleanup-policy keep \\\n    33\t  --resume\n    34\t```\n    35\t\n    36\t## Artefatos persistidos\n    37\t\n    38\t- `manifest.json`: manifesto ordenado por `index`, com `startMs`, `endMs` e `chunkPath`\n    39\t- `job-state.json`: estado autoritativo do job e dos chunks\n    40\t- `chunks/*.wav`: audio intermediario padronizado em PCM 16-bit, mono, `16000 Hz`\n    41\t- `transcripts/*.md`: markdown parcial por chunk\n    42\t- `transcript.md`: consolidado final, apenas no caminho 100% bem-sucedido\n    43\t\n    44\t## Semantica operacional\n    45\t\n    46\t- Sem `--resume`, a CLI rejeita `outputDir` que ja contenha `manifest.json` ou `job-state.json`\n    47\t- `--resume` valida snapshot de compatibilidade com `resolvedInputPath`, `inputSizeBytes`, `inputMtimeMs`, `provider` e `chunkDurationSeconds`\n    48\t- Chunks `failed` e `running` orfaos sao rebaixados para `pending` durante a retomada\n    49\t- `exit code 0` indica sucesso total\n    50\t- `exit code 2` indica falha parcial reaproveitavel\n    51\t- `exit code 1` indica erro fatal ou uso invalido\n    52\t\n    53\t## Scripts\n    54\t\n    55\t- `npm run build`\n    56\t- `npm test`\n    57\t- `npm run verify:long-input`\n    58\t\n    59\t## Extensao de provedores\n    60\t\n    61\tO orquestrador depende apenas do contrato [`Transcriber`](./src/domain/ports/transcriber.ts). Para adicionar um provedor real:\n    62\t\n    63\t1. implemente a interface em `src/infrastructure/providers/`\n    64\t2. conecte a selecao do provedor em [`main.ts`](./src/cli/main.ts)\n    65\t3. mantenha a mesma entrada estavel (`audioPath`, `chunkIndex`, `startMs`, `endMs`)\n","tool_use_id":"call_tEmd8CDqKw9FKrNDjCwXKhDr"}
2026-04-10T15:34:36.335Z PostToolUse status=unknown {"session_id":"019d77ee-8ec1-7641-9021-76f0e1597510","turn_id":"019d77ef-dcf7-76b3-95c4-e865c310d26c","transcript_path":"/home/gabriel/.codex/sessions/2026/04/10/rollout-2026-04-10T12-06-56-019d77ee-8ec1-7641-9021-76f0e1597510.jsonl","cwd":"/home/gabriel/personals/dnd-transcription","hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","model":"gpt-5.4","permission_mode":"default","tool_name":"Bash","tool_input":{"command":"nl -ba scripts/verify-long-input.ts | sed -n '1,220p'"},"tool_response":"     1\timport assert from \"node:assert/strict\";\n     2\timport { mkdtemp, readFile, rm } from \"node:fs/promises\";\n     3\timport { tmpdir } from \"node:os\";\n     4\timport { join } from \"node:path\";\n     5\t\n     6\timport { runCli } from \"../src/cli/main.js\";\n     7\timport { ExternalCommandError } from \"../src/shared/errors.js\";\n     8\timport { runCommand } from \"../src/shared/process.js\";\n     9\t\n    10\tconst LONG_DURATION_SECONDS = 11_160;\n    11\tconst CHUNK_DURATION_SECONDS = 600;\n    12\t\n    13\tasync function main(): Promise<void> {\n    14\t  const root = await mkdtemp(join(tmpdir(), \"dnd-transcription-long-\"));\n    15\t  const inputPath = join(root, \"long-input.mkv\");\n    16\t  const outputDir = join(root, \"job\");\n    17\t\n    18\t  try {\n    19\t    await runCommand([\n    20\t      \"ffmpeg\",\n    21\t      \"-hide_banner\",\n    22\t      \"-loglevel\",\n    23\t      \"error\",\n    24\t      \"-y\",\n    25\t      \"-f\",\n    26\t      \"lavfi\",\n    27\t      \"-i\",\n    28\t      \"anullsrc=r=16000:cl=mono\",\n    29\t      \"-t\",\n    30\t      String(LONG_DURATION_SECONDS),\n    31\t      \"-c:a\",\n    32\t      \"aac\",\n    33\t      \"-b:a\",\n    34\t      \"16k\",\n    35\t      inputPath,\n    36\t    ]);\n    37\t\n    38\t    const exitCode = await runCli([\n    39\t      \"--input\",\n    40\t      inputPath,\n    41\t      \"--output\",\n    42\t      outputDir,\n    43\t      \"--chunk-duration-seconds\",\n    44\t      String(CHUNK_DURATION_SECONDS),\n    45\t      \"--concurrency\",\n    46\t      \"4\",\n    47\t      \"--provider\",\n    48\t      \"fake\",\n    49\t      \"--cleanup-policy\",\n    50\t      \"keep\",\n    51\t    ]);\n    52\t\n    53\t    assert.equal(exitCode, 0);\n    54\t\n    55\t    const manifest = JSON.parse(await readFile(join(outputDir, \"manifest.json\"), \"utf8\")) as {\n    56\t      chunks: Array<{ startMs: number; endMs: number }>;\n    57\t    };\n    58\t    const expectedChunkCount = Math.ceil(LONG_DURATION_SECONDS / CHUNK_DURATION_SECONDS);\n    59\t\n    60\t    assert.equal(manifest.chunks.length, expectedChunkCount);\n    61\t    assert.equal(manifest.chunks[expectedChunkCount - 1]?.endMs, LONG_DURATION_SECONDS * 1_000);\n    62\t\n    63\t    process.stdout.write(`Long input verification succeeded with ${expectedChunkCount} chunks.\\n`);\n    64\t  } finally {\n    65\t    await rm(root, { recursive: true, force: true });\n    66\t  }\n    67\t}\n    68\t\n    69\ttry {\n    70\t  await main();\n    71\t} catch (error) {\n    72\t  const message = error instanceof ExternalCommandError\n    73\t    ? `${error.message}\\n${error.stderr}`.trim()\n    74\t    : error instanceof Error\n    75\t      ? error.message\n    76\t      : String(error);\n    77\t  process.stderr.write(`${message}\\n`);\n    78\t  process.exitCode = 1;\n    79\t}\n","tool_use_id":"call_STeV3GrXUL8xOqpFMh0Ny6ZP"}
